<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link href="../css/cssdir/out.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.7.1.min.js"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <title>Documentação - Manager Bot</title>
</head>

<body class="bg-[#0f1115] text-slate-200 min-h-screen flex flex-col font-sans selection:bg-indigo-500 selection:text-white antialiased overflow-x-hidden">
    
    <!-- Background Decorators -->
    <div class="fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-indigo-900/20 via-[#0f1115] to-[#0f1115]"></div>
        <div class="absolute -top-[40%] -right-[10%] w-[70%] h-[70%] rounded-full bg-indigo-600/10 blur-[120px]"></div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-[20%] -left-[10%] w-[50%] h-[50%] rounded-full bg-purple-600/10 blur-[100px]"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Navigation -->
    <header class="fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-50 bg-[#0f1115]/50 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-white/5 transition-all duration-300">
        <nav class="container mx-auto flex items-center justify-between p-4 lg:px-8" aria-label="Global">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <a href="/" class="relative group">
                    <div class="absolute -inset-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 to-purple-600 rounded-2xl blur opacity-30 group-hover:opacity-70 transition duration-500"></div>
                    <img class="relative h-10 w-10 rounded-2xl object-cover shadow-2xl" src="/res/serverIcon/boticon.jpg" alt="Bot Icon">
                </a>
                <span class="font-bold text-xl tracking-tight text-white/90">Manager Bot</span>
            </div>
            
            <div class="hidden lg:flex lg:gap-x-10">
                <a href="/auth/about" class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 pb-1">Sobre</a>
                <a href="/auth/docs" class="text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors duration-200 border-b-2 border-indigo-500 pb-1">Documentação</a>
                <a href="/auth/funcutils" class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 pb-1">Utilidades & Funções</a>
                <a href="/auth/devs" class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 pb-1">Devs</a>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-1 justify-end">
                <a href="/auth/discord" class="group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-all duration-200 bg-indigo-600/80 border border-indigo-500/50 rounded-full hover:bg-indigo-500 hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(99,102,241,0.4)] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-[#0f1115]">
                    <span>Painel</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <main class="relative z-10 flex-grow pt-32 pb-20 px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl animate-fade-in-up">
            <div class="text-center mb-16">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">
                    A Divina Liricidade
                </div>
                <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-white to-slate-400 mb-6">
                    Documentação
                </h1>
                <p class="text-xl text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                    Estruturamento e Definição de Pastas (v1.0.0)
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-8">
                <div class="bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-10 backdrop-blur-md shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-indigo-500/30 hover:bg-white/[0.04] transition-all duration-500">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-white/5 pb-4">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-folder-tree text-indigo-400"></i> Esquema de Diretórios
                    </h2>
                    
                    <p class="text-slate-400 mb-8 italic">
                        As pastas contidas nos arquivos fonte representam cada seção de módulos do bot. Entenda a arquitetura do sistema:
                    </p>

                    <div class="space-y-6">
                        <!-- Item -->
                        <div class="flex gap-4 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-black/20 border border-white/5 hover:border-indigo-500/20 transition-colors">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 flex-shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 flex items-center justify-center border border-blue-500/20">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-server text-blue-400"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-1">Client</h3>
                                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Esse diretório é responsável por configurar e estabelecer as funcionalidades do bot diretamente no cliente (API) do Discord.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Item -->
                        <div class="flex gap-4 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-black/20 border border-white/5 hover:border-indigo-500/20 transition-colors">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 flex-shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 flex items-center justify-center border border-emerald-500/20">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-database text-emerald-400"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-1">Database</h3>
                                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Responsável por configurar, conectar e estabelecer os métodos de persistência do banco de dados para garantir o funcionamento stateful do bot.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Item -->
                        <div class="flex gap-4 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-black/20 border border-white/5 hover:border-indigo-500/20 transition-colors">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 flex-shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-orange-500/10 flex items-center justify-center border border-orange-500/20">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-microchip text-orange-400"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-1">Functions</h3>
                                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Aqui ficam definidos e configurados os comportamentos lógicos e rotinas das funções autônomas do bot.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Item -->
                        <div class="flex gap-4 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-black/20 border border-white/5 hover:border-indigo-500/20 transition-colors">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 flex-shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-yellow-500/10 flex items-center justify-center border border-yellow-500/20">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-truck-fast text-yellow-400"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-1">Loaders</h3>
                                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Handlers de inicialização. Este diretório define e carrega todos os módulos necessários para o bot inicializar e operar.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Item -->
                        <div class="flex gap-4 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-black/20 border border-white/5 hover:border-indigo-500/20 transition-colors">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 flex-shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 flex items-center justify-center border border-purple-500/20">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-terminal text-purple-400"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-1">Slash</h3>
                                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Contém as estruturas e lógicas dos Comandos de Barra (Slash Commands) que os usuários interagem nos servidores do Discord.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Item -->
                        <div class="flex gap-4 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-black/20 border border-white/5 hover:border-indigo-500/20 transition-colors">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 flex-shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-teal-500/10 flex items-center justify-center border border-teal-500/20">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-toolbox text-teal-400"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-1">Utils</h3>
                                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Coleção de funções utilitárias e ajudantes compartilhadas por todo o código base.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <style>
        @keyframes fade-in-up {
            0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
            100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        .animate-fade-in-up {
            animation: fade-in-up 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
            opacity: 0;
        }
    </style>
</body>
</html>